 "transcript": [
  "[action] Wang Lung works the soil with his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is so and I am ashamed, for they are so proud and so mean and they care so little for their father and their land. And it is so that I have not told them and I have not made them understand and now I see that my father will not die and I must be ashamed and have shame in my heart and I must make them understand and I must take them to me and I must make them see and I must make them see.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung listens to his son's words.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung asks his son to explain his feelings.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Tell me again what you mean, for I do not understand what you mean.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Tell me again what you mean, for I do not understand what you mean.\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now, my heart? What have you more to say? I do not understand you, my child.\"",
  "[action] The second son stands silently.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son walks in silence.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I must not take them to me and I must not make them see, for it is not good for my sons to see me and my wife and to see the sons of the rich men of the town and for they to see me and to know me and to know that I have a wife and that I have sons and that I have money and I must not and I must not and I must not.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son leaves his father and brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and and what, now?\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"There is no more need to speak. We are all to have nothing and we are all to be slaves to the great men and to their sons.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son walks silently.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son follows his brother.",
  "[action] Wang Lung looks at his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"But I will not be a slave to any of them and I will not be a slave and I will not see and I will not see and I will not see and I will not see and I will not see and I will not see.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing."
